Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Legends of Sports Heroes: Dunk for Victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.80,Title,,0,0,0,,Craze
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:36.96,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued…
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,In the previous episode, Team Defenders built up a massive lead over Team Lion Heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.72,0:00:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and Team Lion Heart’s flaws are gradually being exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Lion Jay felt a huge crisis and was constantly battling his inner thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.28,0:00:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But when Lion Jay shed his idol persona,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,his true power was breathtaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How will Team Goats protect their lead?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.52,0:01:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t see the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.96,0:01:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.24,0:01:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.48,0:01:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders calls a timeout.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.40,0:02:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You probably already know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay’s awakening is that one percent chance of us losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.32,0:02:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes on him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.88,0:02:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, I just want to beat Team Lion Heart when they’re going all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.44,0:02:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Going all out is the ultimate respect you can show your opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.68,0:02:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let’s go over our last three plays.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.92,0:02:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re defense, defense, and defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hold onto our lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.84,0:02:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it, Coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, the game is back underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re not getting past me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.68,0:03:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie is looking to break through Team Lion Heart’s defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Will his composure allow him to buy a bucket?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay! It’s Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.80,0:03:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This defensive pressure is suffocating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.04,0:03:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Can Weslie blow past him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.84,0:03:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stripped!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What a steal by Lion Jay! Unbelievable reflexes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back on D!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.24,0:04:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s going out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.16,0:04:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.28,0:04:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m good. I’m good. Thanks for the support.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.44,0:04:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay is really going all out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.16,0:04:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hustle back on defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.36,0:04:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, Lion Jay like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.36,0:04:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, we’re going man-to-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, lock them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.56,0:04:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,is still so fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay has given us so much this whole time…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.52,0:05:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,yet we turned on him just because he changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.44,0:05:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Winning or losing doesn’t matter, as long as you have a good image.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who kept you on this team?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.28,0:05:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who built you up into a basketball star?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.72,0:05:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,For us to be like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.04,0:05:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,we were so selfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.96,0:05:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we should be cheering for the real Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.31,0:05:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We should back the real Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.60,0:05:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let’s hear it for Lion Jay one more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.28,0:05:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,—Lion Jay, Lion Jay!　—Cool guy of the Milky Way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.12,0:05:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, Lion Jay, cool guy of the Milky Way!\NLion Jay, Lion Jay, my number one every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Was I being too selfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, Lion Jay, cool guy of the Milky Way!\NLion Jay, Lion Jay, my number one every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.44,0:06:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re closing the gap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.96,0:06:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Lion Jay going completely all out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I’ll head back with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.64,0:07:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t hang out with these weaklings anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If the paparazzi snap you, it will ruin your image.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so good to see him finally being himself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.96,0:07:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So you see, looking cool isn’t what matters on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.32,0:07:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fundamentals are everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to prove myself…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and that my basketball…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.32,0:07:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,isn’t just all hype.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.04,0:07:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.40,0:07:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not lose to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All-out defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.32,0:08:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The little goats finally score again, snapping Team Lion Heart’s scoring run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.68,0:08:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.68,0:08:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you’re going to play seriously, you’d better not lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t embarrass me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.60,0:09:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Go enjoy basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.76,0:09:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Lion Heart, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.56,0:09:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The game between Team Lion Heart and Team Defenders is so intense!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The score is so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those goats really that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.24,0:09:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Goats is no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.28,0:09:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I made a promise
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,to see them in the finals!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.68,0:10:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Only 10 seconds left!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Lion Heart has erased a massive deficit and trails by only one point!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.36,0:10:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This game is an absolute heart-stopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.60,0:10:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will ultimately emerge victorious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders’ crucial shot is rejected by Team Lion Heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.04,0:10:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay! It’s Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay secures the loose ball and pushes the break against Team Defenders!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back on D! Hurry, hustle back on D!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders is scrambling into secondary transition defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.16,0:10:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Can they stop Lion Jay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.32,0:10:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be Team Lion Heart’s final possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Time…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.72,0:10:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.31,0:10:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the shot, Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.75,0:11:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.08,0:11:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.20,0:11:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.00,0:11:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the opportunity I’ve finally managed to seize.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.04,0:11:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can stop me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.24,0:11:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what reason do I have…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.44,0:12:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,to stop right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.28,0:12:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is to be the one…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,who fights for victory…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.92,0:12:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,as a basketball player!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
